    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an employee of Juice\u2122, you wake up to a beautiful new day. While the urge to get to work is strong, there\u2019s still time to tidy up at home and choose your outfit for the day. Once everything feels just right, you head off to your beloved Juice\u2122 battery factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937610/extras/9c44f715b65571003ef0a122ad6e2439.poster.avif?t=1743932183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937610/extras/9c44f715b65571003ef0a122ad6e2439.webm?t=1743932183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937610/extras/9c44f715b65571003ef0a122ad6e2439.mp4?t=1743932183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this puzzle adventure, featuring 80s-styled graphics and modern physics, things are not always as straightforward as they seem. What starts as a simple journey to get to work turns into an adventure filled with obstacles, strange creatures, and inexplicable events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Easy, customisable, controls using keyboard, gamepad, or touch input</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Learn new abilities and combine them as game progresses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Bite-sized levels* with unique problems to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Should run on a potato, see requirements for specifics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*Includes a subscription to Juice\u2122 Reconstruction Service.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937610/extras/9d15b4dc4746c59f484b0756bb7f21d7.webp?t=1743932183\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an employee of Juice\u2122, you wake up to a beautiful new day. While the urge to get to work is strong, there\u2019s still time to tidy up at home and choose your outfit for the day. Once everything feels just right, you head off to your beloved Juice\u2122 battery factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937610/extras/9c44f715b65571003ef0a122ad6e2439.poster.avif?t=1743932183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937610/extras/9c44f715b65571003ef0a122ad6e2439.webm?t=1743932183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937610/extras/9c44f715b65571003ef0a122ad6e2439.mp4?t=1743932183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this puzzle adventure, featuring 80s-styled graphics and modern physics, things are not always as straightforward as they seem. What starts as a simple journey to get to work turns into an adventure filled with obstacles, strange creatures, and inexplicable events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Easy, customisable, controls using keyboard, gamepad, or touch input</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Learn new abilities and combine them as game progresses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Bite-sized levels* with unique problems to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Should run on a potato, see requirements for specifics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*Includes a subscription to Juice\u2122 Reconstruction Service.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937610/extras/9d15b4dc4746c59f484b0756bb7f21d7.webp?t=1743932183\" /></div></p>",
